<header class="hdr">
  <div class="wrap hdr-in">
    <a class="logo" href="/"><span class="led bv-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span>CuSS<span class="sr"> home</span></a>
    {#- Contact · About · the settings gear, in the top right corner, on every width (design README, Header).
        Services and Work live on the home page and in the footer; there is no menu. #}
    <div class="hdr-end">
      <nav class="hdr-nav" aria-label="Main">
        <a class="btn btn-contact btn-hdr bv-md" href="/contact/"{% if section == 'contact' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>Contact</a>
        <a class="btn btn-hdr bv-md" href="/about/"{% if section == 'about' %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>About</a>
      </nav>
      {#- Settings gear (2026-11-27): opens a panel underneath with the theme and motion switches (rule 9). Each label
          names what a tap does; site.js keeps the labels in step. Without JavaScript the page follows the system settings. #}
      <div class="hdr-set js-only">
        <button class="ibtn bv-md" type="button" data-settings aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hdr-panel" aria-label="Display settings" title="Display settings">{% icon "settings" %}</button>
        <div class="hdr-panel" id="hdr-panel" role="group" aria-label="Display settings" hidden>
          <button class="btn bv-md" type="button" data-theme-toggle>{% icon "sun", "i-sun" %}{% icon "moon", "i-moon" %}<span data-lbl>Daylight theme</span></button>
          <button class="btn bv-md" type="button" data-motion-toggle>{% icon "pause", "i-pause" %}{% icon "play", "i-play" %}<span data-lbl>Stop motion</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
